@title Live view says when no supply is defined
@area Schematic
# A new project has no feeds: nothing can light up. The Live card says so and
# offers to place a feed or add the supply circuit; Why? gives the same answer.
fresh
wait 20
click_text "New project"
wait 40
key shift+l
wait 30
shot live-no-supply
tree supply
expect "No supply is defined in this drawing"
expect "Place a feed"
expect "Add supply circuit"
check_layout
click_text "Why?"
wait 10
expect "Until a feed is placed"
click_text "Place a feed"
wait 20
shot live-place-feed
